  "title": "Jalapeño Jelly",
  "description": "This jalapeño jelly has the best balance of flavor. It's easy to make and its pepper taste and spicy kick tastes great with cheese or cold meats.",
  "authors": [
    "Sue Delgrego"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:08:48-04:00",
